sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant H as Order HTTP handler
    participant S as Order service
    participant R as Order repository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    C->>H: POST /orders (product_id, quantity)
    H->>H: Validate JSON and JWT
    H->>S: CreateOrder(user, product, quantity)
    S->>R: BeginTx + load active product
    S->>R: Atomic UPDATE inventory WHERE available >= quantity
    alt no stock / product missing / subsequent write fails
        R-->>S: error / no row
        S->>DB: Rollback deferred transaction
        S-->>H: domain error
        H-->>C: 404 or 409 / 400 JSON
    else stock reserved
        S->>R: INSERT order and order item
        S->>R: INSERT ORDER_RESERVED audit movement
        S->>DB: Commit transaction
        S-->>H: order ID + PENDING + total paise
        H-->>C: 201 JSON
    end
